[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12365.11, "timestamp": "03:26:05", "text": "カリスト、じゃあ私はこうすると思う。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12367.67, "timestamp": "03:26:07", "text": "ええ、ケリスは主要なダメージディーラーです"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12370.95, "timestamp": "03:26:10", "text": "けれど。何があっても、彼は主役だ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12373.63, "timestamp": "03:26:13", "text": "損害を与える者。それで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12379.63, "timestamp": "03:26:19", "text": "うん、彼女のレベルを上げる必要がある"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12382.269, "timestamp": "03:26:22", "text": "すぐ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12385.83, "timestamp": "03:26:25", "text": "ロバーズ、このゲームは本当に単調だよ。それで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12404.04, "timestamp": "03:26:44", "text": "わかった。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12406.83, "timestamp": "03:26:46", "text": "[音楽]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12413.98, "timestamp": "03:26:53", "text": "私"}]